<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - October 14.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - October 14.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bunga Kesidang (built 1982) 65,960 dwt del Newcastle end-Oct redel Taiwan $7,000 daily plus $110,000 bonus Yangming Line.</p>
<p>Captain George Tsangaris (built 1982) 61,349 dwt del NoPacific 15-25/10 redel Bin Qasim $7,000 daily plus $150,000 bonus Panocean.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859-1640</p>
